    "detailed_description": "<h1>Speedrun Features &amp; Twitch Integration</h1><p>These are important to us, we are currently working hard to make them as crab! as possible.<br><br>Getting hooked? Wishlist and stay tuned!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331180/extras/9917e7e92e5a11fad6dfc4cefe11584a.poster.avif?t=1750165441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331180/extras/9917e7e92e5a11fad6dfc4cefe11584a.webm?t=1750165441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331180/extras/9917e7e92e5a11fad6dfc4cefe11584a.mp4?t=1750165441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Channel your inner crustacean and face this rage-platformer about a young crab embarking on its revenge trip to the moon! <br><br>Use your grappling hook to reach new heights. <br><br>But take good care! When you hit your head, you loose control and the young crab starts spiraling downwards in a pinball-like manner. <br>Can you get up again? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331180/extras/9edfd92071bf0c0eb7213481c62597c1.poster.avif?t=1750165441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331180/extras/9edfd92071bf0c0eb7213481c62597c1.webm?t=1750165441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331180/extras/9edfd92071bf0c0eb7213481c62597c1.mp4?t=1750165441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
